sequenceDiagram
  participant B as B Glove
  participant A as A Platform (ESP32 + bridge)
  participant C as C Vision
  participant E as E Control Station
  loop 50 Hz
    B->>A: GloveData (hand tilt)
    A->>A: map hand tilt → plate tilt (within limits)
    A->>E: platform/state, glove/state
  end
  loop every camera frame
    C->>E: vision/ball, plan/route
    E->>E: progress, warnings, exit check
  end
  E->>A: game/warning (e.g. not_moving)
  A->>B: Haptic (pattern, intensity)
  C->>E: is_on_exit for exit_hold_frames frames
  E->>A: game/state finished
  A->>A: level the plate
